<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ site.lang }}">
  <head>
    {% include head.liquid %}
    {% include ringworld_styles.liquid %}
  </head>

  <body class="rw-site">
    <header class="rw-masthead">
      <div class="rw-shell rw-masthead-inner">
        <a class="rw-brand" href="{{ '/ringworld/' | relative_url }}" aria-label="ringworld — home">
          <img class="rw-brand-ring" src="{{ '/assets/img/ringworld/mark.png' | relative_url }}" alt="" width="480" height="263" />
          <span class="rw-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
        {%- comment -%}
          The sibling pill is the LAST nav item on both micro-sites, and both
          mastheads share a shell width and height, so the two clubs' marks land
          on exactly the same pixel — click through and the link you just used is
          under your cursor again.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <nav class="rw-topnav">
          {%- comment -%}
            STATIC-LANDING MODE: the Luma link is dropped for now — the pill is
            the only nav item, and it is still LAST, so the pixel contract with
            MLn's masthead holds.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            The label is MLn's own lettering, not type — same rule as both
            brands. It is an alpha mask, so the accessible name comes from
            aria-label rather than from text.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <a class="rw-sibling" href="{{ '/mln/' | relative_url }}" aria-label="MLn Reading Club — the sibling reading group">
            <span class="rw-sibling-ico" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="rw-sibling-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    {%- comment -%}
      Sitewide, not just the landing page — the whole micro-site is still being
      built. Currently off — flip `under_construction` in _data/ringworld.yml.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if site.data.ringworld.under_construction -%}
    <div class="rw-construction">
      <div class="rw-shell">
        <span aria-hidden="true">🚧</span>
        <strong>Under construction.</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <main class="rw-main" role="main">
      {{ content }}
    </main>

    <footer class="rw-foot">
      <div class="rw-shell rw-foot-inner">
        <span class="rw-foot-name">ringworld</span>
        <span class="rw-foot-dot">·</span>
        <span>Pittsburgh · Sundays 4–7pm</span>
        <span class="rw-foot-dot">·</span>
        <span>a <a href="{{ site.data.ringworld.socratica_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Socratica node ↗</a></span>
        <a class="rw-foot-by" href="{{ '/' | relative_url }}">by Chris Shi</a>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Hidden theme toggle: al-folio's theme.js wires listeners to these IDs on load.
         This micro-site's masthead has no toggle, so we keep them present but hidden
         to avoid a null-addEventListener crash that would halt all page JS. -->
    <button id="light-toggle" title="Change theme" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true">
      <i class="ti ti-sun-moon" id="light-toggle-system"></i>
      <i class="ti ti-moon-filled" id="light-toggle-dark"></i>
      <i class="ti ti-sun-filled" id="light-toggle-light"></i>
    </button>

    {% include scripts.liquid %}
  </body>
</html>
